<title>FINLAND: HARTWALL 1996 PROFIT RISES 354 PCT.</title>
<headline>HARTWALL 1996 PROFIT RISES 354 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		 207.5 up 354 pct</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   8.40 vs 0.52</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,000 up 16.1 pct</p>
<p> Operating profit				   238 up 179.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Finnish beverages maker is Oy Hartwall</p>
<p>Ab. The company said the earnings figures wewre preliminary.</p>
<p>Official results will be published on February 27.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
